// v3.0 accumulated ONE transmittance from the moving density and handed it to
// the composite as the scene's dimming factor. That meant a model standing in
// completely unlit air still breathed brighter and darker as the fog drifted
// past — a slow, global shimmer over the whole picture, which is exactly the
